== Effects ==
* If Isaac has half a heart or less after taking damage, this trinket drops a {{e|Black Heart}}.
* The effect can trigger up to three times, after which the trinket will disappear.
** The fingers stuck out by the paw will change to display the number of triggers left.

== Notes ==
* The effect can trigger more than once in the same room.
* The effect does not trigger when picked up at half a heart or less.
* {{dlc|a+}} If Gulped or smelted, its effect still only triggers 3 times, then disappears.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Each copy allows Monkey Paw to drop an extra black heart.
* {{i|Scapular}}: If Scapular's effect is triggered, the {{e|Soul Heart}} awarded will not cancel the effect of Monkey Paw.

